    }
  },
  {
    "index": 10,
    "hash": "8qiSeDZ1OtLLz5wRARt+a18dm+k=",
    "timestampUtcMs": "2026-08-13T15:46:21.151Z",
    "action": {
      "type": "SET_DESCRIPTION",
      "input": {
        "updatedAt": "2026-08-13T15:46:20.000Z",
        "description": "Import Form, StringField and BooleanField from document-engineering/scalars. Checkbox is internal-only and not exported. The package is versioned separately from the stack."
      },
      "timestampUtcMs": "2026-08-13T15:46:21.151Z"
    }
  },
  {
    "index": 11,
    "hash": "hTYMSBhZ1TSlwTvZVM6bTuuBKug=",
    "timestampUtcMs": "2026-08-13T15:46:21.151Z",
    "action": {
      "type": "SET_CONTENT",
      "input": {
        "content": "`@powerhousedao/document-engineering` provides pre-built components, many keyed to GraphQL scalar types so they line up with document-model schemas. The form tier is imported from the `/scalars` subpath:\n\n```tsx\nimport { Form, StringField, BooleanField } from \"@powerhousedao/document-engineering/scalars\";\n```\n\n**There is no `Checkbox` export.** The boolean input is `BooleanField`, exported from `src/scalars/components/boolean-field/index.ts`. The string `Checkbox` does appear inside the repo (22 files) but only as internal implementation and story naming \u2014 it is not exported from any index, so importing it will fail.\n\nThe scalar-backed field components under `src/scalars/components/` are: `aid-field`, `amount-field`, `boolean-field`, `country-code-field`, `currency-code-field`, `date-picker-field`, `date-time-picker-field`, `email-field`, `enum-field`, `file-field`, `id-field`, `number-field`, `oid-field`, `password-field`, `phid-field`, `phone-number-field`, `string-field`, `time-picker-field`, `url-field`, plus `form` and shared `fragments`.\n\nComponents are explored in Storybook. The repo itself only documents running it locally (`pnpm storybook`, per `README.md:95`); the hosted `storybook.powerhouse.academy` URL is asserted by the academy docs and cannot be confirmed from this repo.\n\nNote this package is versioned independently of the Powerhouse stack \u2014 pinned as a dependency (`1.40.5`), not built from the powerhouse monorepo, so its symbols will never appear in a monorepo grep.\n\n_Source-verified 2026-08-13 against the document-engineering repo at v1.40.5 (`/home/p/Powerhouse/document-engineering`), a separate repo from the powerhouse monorepo._",
        "updatedAt": "2026-08-13T15:46:20.000Z"
      },
      "timestampUtcMs": "2026-08-13T15:46:21.151Z"
    }
  },
